      "cooked": "<p>Hello all. &nbsp;So I have unboxed my tactics and was trying to organize it. &nbsp;I was hoping to keep tokens that are specific to a hero/villain with them. &nbsp;However there are some tokens I am unsure who they go with as I have not explored all the cards yet. &nbsp;There isn't a list anywhere and was wondering if someone has made one/ is willing to make one. &nbsp; Like wise with mini's. &nbsp;The bases have names, however the statues do not have labels. &nbsp;It would be awesome to have a picture of the packaging with the names of which one is which on it. &nbsp;</p>",
